      "label": "Students eligible for upper secondary school who have completed grade 9 by time in Sweden, foreign/Swedish background and background variable. Year 2023/24-2024/25",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2026-06-30T06:00:00Z",
      "link": {
